<title>UK: Merrill Lynch set calls on Alusuisse-Lonza Holding.</title>
<headline>Merrill Lynch set calls on Alusuisse-Lonza Holding.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch Capital Markets AG, Zurich, said it has issued two million American-style call warrants, on Alusuisse-Lonza Holding AG registered shares.</p>
<p>One share is controlled by 20 warrants.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    1150 CHF		  PREMIUM	11.90 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     5.15 CHF		  GEARING	10.80 X</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 03.FEB.97-19.JUN.98   PAYDATE	29.JAN.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS EXCHANGE	  MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  1120 CHF</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
